<title>HONG KONG: Deson Development seen in HK$75 mln float - sources.</title>
<headline>Deson Development seen in HK$75 mln float - sources.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction concern Deson Development International Holdings Ltd is expected to raise about HK$75 million in an initial public offering (IPO) of shares in Hong Kong, sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>Sources said the IPO is expected to begin later in May, with dealing in the shares to begin in mid-June. Pacific Challenge Securities is expected to be the sponsor of the issue.</p>
<p>The Hong Kong-based company engages in building construction in China.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available, the sources said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
